      "id": "expr-env",
      "name": "Expression environment",
      "kind": "struct",
      "description": "strata_kernel expr.rs Env as the environment of eval(tenant-rule-language, ...): one field per scope of the language. record, old and new are a record's fields and system attributes ($id, $version, $created_by, $created_at, $updated_at), null when there is no record; param the supplied parameters; now a time value; principal the acting user's id as a string, or null; has_role the roles held. The kernel's lookup (following a reference) has no field: see the report of WG-4937.",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "record",
