          "type": "list<string>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "expr-check-env",
      "name": "Expression check environment",
      "kind": "struct",
      "description": "strata_kernel expr.rs TypeEnv as the environment of check(tenant-rule-language, ...): the shape of each field at the definition site (str, int, bool, time, ref, list), the declared parameters and roles. TypeEnv.objects (for checking a reference hop) has no field: check gives a hop the any shape.",
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "fields",
